Overview
CarbonTally uses Supabase Realtime to provide live updates across the platform without page refreshes. This enables real-time collaboration between customers and staff, instant notifications, and live status updates.

Key Capabilities
Feature	Description
Live Notifications	Instant alerts for document status changes, approvals, and assignments
Real-time Chat	Instant messaging with typing indicators and read receipts
Document Status	Live updates on document processing progress
Staff Presence	See who's online in real-time
Activity Feed	Live feed of all platform activities
Queue Updates	Real-time review queue changes
Approval Workflow	Instant approval/rejection updates
