API Reference
Realtime Manager Methods
Method	Description
initialize(user)	Initialize with user data
connect()	Connect to all channels
disconnect()	Disconnect all channels
on(event, callback)	Register event listener
off(event, callback)	Remove event listener
sendTyping(conversationId, isTyping)	Send typing indicator
sendReadReceipt(conversationId, messageId)	Send read receipt
Events
Event	Payload	Description
CONNECTED	{ user }	Connection established
DISCONNECTED	{}	Connection lost
NOTIFICATION_INSERT	{ new }	New notification
MESSAGE_INSERT	{ new }	New message
DOCUMENT_UPDATE	{ new, old }	Document updated
PRESENCE_UPDATE	{ online }	Presence changed
Frontend Hooks
Hook	Description
useRealtime()	Access Realtime context
